  ("Current Electricity: Resistance R = rho L / A depends on length, cross-section and material. Resistors in series add, R = R1 + R2; in parallel 1/R = 1/R1 + 1/R2, so the combination is smaller than the smallest resistor.", "easy", "formula misapplication"),
