  ("Magnetism: Field of a long straight wire B = mu0 I/(2 pi r); at the centre of a circular loop B = mu0 I/(2R); inside a long solenoid B = mu0 n I. Here mu0 = 4 pi x 10^-7 T m/A.", "medium", "formula misapplication"),
